\ IIS for scheduling_infeasible.lp
\ The three shift minimums (20+18+15=53 worker-shifts) exceed
\ total capacity (30) even at maximum per-worker hours.
Minimize
 obj: 0
Subject To
 shift_morning:   w1 + w2 >= 20
 shift_afternoon: w2 + w3 >= 18
 shift_night:     w3 + w4 >= 15
 capacity_total:  w1 + w2 + w3 + w4 <= 30
 max_w1: w1 <= 8
 max_w2: w2 <= 8
 max_w3: w3 <= 8
 max_w4: w4 <= 6
Bounds
 0 <= w1 <= 8
 0 <= w2 <= 8
 0 <= w3 <= 8
 0 <= w4 <= 6
End
